id: BUILD-001
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: advisory
title: React hook called inside conditional or loop
category: build
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: use
patterns:
  - regex: (if|for|while|switch)\s*\(.*\).*use(State|Effect|Memo|Callback|Ref|Context|Reducer)\(
    message: "React hook inside conditional/loop — hooks must be called at the top level of the component on every render"
  - regex: \?\s*use(State|Effect|Memo|Callback|Ref|Context|Reducer)\(
    message: "React hook in ternary expression — hooks must be called unconditionally"
  - regex: &&\s*use(State|Effect|Memo|Callback|Ref|Context|Reducer)\(
    message: "React hook after && short-circuit — hooks must be called on every render path"
fix: Move hooks to the top of the component function. Put conditionals inside the hook callback instead.
